# kosmocrates' own definition-of-done — the instrument measures itself.
#
# This is the spiral through its own centre: the kosmo-run tool, expressed as a
# wishlist of its declared structural skeleton, checked by the suite against the
# live source (tests/dogfood.rs). A self-referential regression guard — if the
# backbone is ever cut, the project stops realizing itself.
#
# Scope note (an honest reach-map the instrument drew of itself): the wish
# vocabulary's structural surface is the existence stratum — crates and modules.
# A binary crate's private functions are not a public contract, and Cargo
# dependency edges are not code facets, so neither is wished for here; that is
# the instrument correctly reporting its own surface, not a gap papered over.

a crate kosmo-run
a module doors
a module reforge
